        "id": 133181,
        "name": "Nunleft",
        "username": "Nunleft",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nunleft/{size}/2237_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-23T13:05:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>You might consider playing Silver Gulch to help take out Undrrbosses.</p></blockquote><p>I personally believe that its a personal preference between Insula Primalis and Silver Gulch. I prefer Insula Primalis because you can get 3 Obsidian Fields as opposed to 2 wagons which can blow up thanks to AoE. That being said, taking out the underbosses isn't a problem since Legacy will give between +1 and +2 depending on draw and you have Tempest and Ra who can nuke them from orbit with Fanatic backing them up. There is a reason why all my record times for the digital version are below 4 minutes (advanced and normal,) the team has A LOT of damage. There is a damn good reason why: Legacy, Ra and Tempest all have a 100% pick rate in record times.</p><blockquote><p>As far as the team goes I think your setups are good for doing that.</p></blockquote><p>Which set up would you think is best? The super control with both Wraith and Visionary, or go greedy and pick Fanatic and Visionary. The Reason why Fanatic over Wraith is constancy and synergy with Legacy.</p>",
